	!VAR0516 : 467!
	\L_023ce:
	\L_0237a:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeeeeees?'
	\L_0242f:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah, welcome, Your Majesty.'
	\L_0242f:
	\L_02422:
	\L_0230a:
	ZH 1:
	'I heard in town that you’re'
	R
	'still living out here. Why? The'
	R
	'place is abandoned.'
	\L_0242f:
	\L_02422:
	\L_0237a:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	R
	'But I still have some cleaning'
	R
	'up to do...'
	\L_0242f:
	ZH 1:
	'Because I watched over many'
	R
	'lives here... There’s things'
	R
	'that only I can tidy up...'
	\L_0242f:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0242f:
	ZH 1:
	'And if I stay here, eventually'
	R
	'he might come back...'
	\L_0242f:
	\L_02422:
	\L_0230a:
	ZH 1:
	'Who?'
	\L_0242f:
	\L_02422:
	\L_0237a:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...'
	\L_0242f:
	ZH 1:
	'N-N-Nobody!'
	R
	'Anyway, I’m busy...'
	\L_0242f:
	\L_02422:
	\L_023dc:
	\L_023b2:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory blushed and tears built'
	R
	'up in the corners of her eyes.'
	R
	'She ran away from Rance.'
	\L_0242f:
	\L_02422:
	\L_0230a:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Crap...'
	R
	'Should’ve at least had sex'
	R
	'with me... Damn it...'
	\L_0242f:
	\L_02422:
	\L_0236c:
	\L_023dc:
	\L_02342:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory’s hopes were in vain...'
	R
	'Kite would never show himself'
	R
	'before humans again...'
	\L_0242f:
